      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Pleura:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " the visceral pleura covers the lungs and lines the fissures; the parietal pleura attaches to the thoracic wall, mediastinum and diaphragm; the pleural cavity lies b/n them."
     }
    ]
   },
